  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1226472,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## G-ZERO: Blast Through the Future on Your Game Boy!\n\nPrepare for high-octane, pixel-perfect racing action in *G-ZERO* for the Nintendo Game Boy! Inspired by the classic arcade racer F-Zero, this adrenaline-fueled game throws you into a futuristic Grand Prix where speed and precision are everything. \n\nAs a rookie racer, your mission is to conquer six challenging tracks, each demanding two laps of blistering speed. Navigate tight corners, dodge rival racers, and harness the power of your futuristic vehicle to claim victory. Mastering the tracks is key – a single mistake can send you spinning!\n\n*G-ZERO* delivers a retro racing experience with a modern twist. Featuring vibrant pixel art, a pulse-pounding soundtrack, and simple yet addictive gameplay, it's perfect for quick bursts of arcade fun or longer, competitive races. Can you dominate the G-ZERO Grand Prix and become the ultimate champion? Get ready to floor it!"
    },
